  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The Social System seems to only work half the time and doesn't get invites to friends. You send, they never receive and vise verse. The system needs to work CONSISTENTLY, and if it does not, send back an error message.\nOn that same vein. We need auditory, and visual indicators to join/invite notifications. A lot of the time, users will have their UI off, so they don't see the join request notifications. It would help if there was a sound that played when notifications pop up, a different sound for each type. With that, a visual indicator for Denied requests would also help, so you're not wondering whether if they had seen them or not, and you're not left waiting for no reason.",
